[{"title":"三城留别野望雨望两侄与任山有同赋","author":"何绛","text":"饮酒莫辞醉，别离方在兹。\n晓风吹岸叶，散落珠江湄。\n我客未旬日，子留尚几时。\n相迟谢矰缴，颉顽淩天翨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送圆和尚还丹霞","author":"何绛","text":"自怜闻道寡，益怅别离情。\n挂席又千里，秋风雁翅城。\n丹霞何日到，白露满天行。\n虽觉溪山异，还同一月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41449,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门送契如竹仙两大师归粤","author":"何绛","text":"真僧本无著，何事只怀归。\n好是梅花路，犹堪放钵衣。\n一心能自了，双锡任时飞。\n计日还山寺，庭前雪渐霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41450,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送白大师入山 其一","author":"何绛","text":"但识安心法，皇城亦厌居。\n青山发幽兴，白社得真如。\n勿使一尘染，能令万虑虚。\n春来须策杖，还访尔精庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41451,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送白大师入山 其二","author":"何绛","text":"问师何所适，乃在樵山阴。\n古寺千章木，閒云一片心。\n折花惊晓蚁，出食下幽禽。\n日夕惟清梵，因风度远林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41452,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝日社集西禅寺","author":"何绛","text":"一从兵革后，大雅久云衰。\n声气如今日，风流宛在兹。\n泠泠春夜涧，濯濯柳初枝。\n何以裁诗句，清新倘似之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41453,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼南 其一","author":"何绛","text":"雷阳南岸尽，城郭浪中开。\n古井鱼增老，穷溟雁不来。\n禹粮收木末，猴酒酿山隈。\n风土相逢处，仁蘋荐几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41454,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼南 其二","author":"何绛","text":"奇甸周千里，山川自一方。\n金沙如日赤，铁树与人长。\n石有麋潜影，楠多鸟寄香。\n不因诸物产，长吏更循良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41455,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十八夜多异精舍与超有上人坐月","author":"何绛","text":"松堂钟磬罢，疏露滴秋林。\n好月还终夜，明灯共此心。\n方穷选胜力，不觉入山深。\n自笑红尘里，茫茫何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41456,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"引镜轩黄菊盛开赋呈主人","author":"何绛","text":"众卉皆摇落，一枝良可思。\n非关雨露德，生有岁寒姿。\n无意来华屋，闲情在短篱。\n秋英人素重，知与夕餐宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41457,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄竹早行","author":"何绛","text":"残星落晓岫，白发上轻车。\n春雾含花重，村烟透树疏。\n过桥人影暗，出谷鸟飞初。\n吾亦缘何事，年年靡定居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41458,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"净土禅林访雪嵩大师","author":"何绛","text":"老僧下竹榻，邀我入松扉。\n疏磬依林静，寒云绕殿飞。\n琼南渡海去，江左授衣归。\n竟日焚香坐，无心与是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41459,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨颐斋罢官归冈州诗以送之","author":"何绛","text":"引年辞海国，归棹倚春涛。\n未尽诸生意，空存二疏高。\n清樽开北海，长啸上东皋。\n日涉园成趣，何如五斗劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41460,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿紫贝精舍呈平波上人","author":"何绛","text":"兀坐山中寺，人间无此心。\n溪声空物性，松影过堂阴。\n虚室但清磬，生台多杂禽。\n秋风吹不尽，日日上罗衾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41461,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归里为其先人营葬","author":"何绛","text":"君今渡海还，椰实满秋山。\n野店红鱼饭，溪桥白竹间。\n星霜侵客梦，风木感愁颜。\n去去休惆怅，人生自此閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41462,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄懿士侄时馆罗浮之梅花村此余时在海南诗也","author":"何绛","text":"远游殊未返，閒坐向秋山。\n得汝罗浮信，开余岛屿颜。\n明珰摇酒市，绿醑酌花间。\n莫恋佳人意，经宵尚不还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41463,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊苍梧","author":"何绛","text":"重过苍梧客，扁舟一夜心。\n山川犹昨日，难对在高深。\n芳草绿新恨，春风吹旧林。\n岂无同旅泊，谁识此宵吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41464,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻钟","author":"何绛","text":"苦行僧何在，一敲一听生。\n非关来远近，得处即分明。\n岂但人心觉，直令天地清。\n坐观人境际，雪月夜阶盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41465,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬草","author":"何绛","text":"行尽天涯路，年年见汝衰。\n谁能摇落后，犹有雪霜姿。\n寂寞何人顾，芳荣暗自期。\n平原一睇望，殊作塞垣思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41466,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒树","author":"何绛","text":"空山冬气合，孤干欲如何。\n响处不惊梦，霜声到地多。\n往来禽寂寂，高下月峨峨。\n独立那堪对，洞庭怀暮波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41467,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葛帐","author":"何绛","text":"葛帐张兰室，佳人素手成。\n晚风云影乱，月色上床轻。\n密极难藏梦，垂时无限情。\n十年幽恨事，展转不瞒卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41468,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹杖","author":"何绛","text":"此君怀令节，握手托平生。\n任意成来往，虚心接物情。\n先人一着地，舍己独行名。\n亦自嫌车马，山中少送迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41469,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹榻","author":"何绛","text":"小榻碧如水，所栖非一枝。\n吾生亦有托，安用独醒为。\n远梦凭谁识，孤怀与尔知。\n喜来虽不寐，应念卧薪时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41470,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画叉","author":"何绛","text":"引怀良不易，何以汝偏深。\n委屈空如此，常能令直寻。\n卷舒存至理，山水托知音。\n举世谁相似，从无掩善心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41471,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"麈尾","author":"何绛","text":"王谢当时物，高人日以挥。\n无言开妙论，不悟解玄机。\n来去情难定，尘埃性所违。\n微风亦有意，于汝独依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41472,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笔山","author":"何绛","text":"一掌峰峦尽，还应静者知。\n塞鸿飞不到，秋兔欲藏时。\n势岂千铢累，功非一篑亏。\n虽云最小物，造化亦何私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41473,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纸刀","author":"何绛","text":"自是无长物，微躯日日新。\n敢云悲薄命，常得近文人。\n用舍凭斯世，裁成赖此身。\n年年烽火报，喜不事风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41474,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离六堂","author":"何绛","text":"道由疏磬外，地僻罕人寻。\n一路入来处，泠然生静心。\n绿槐阴过户，垂柳覆栖禽。\n向晚斋钟动，群僧渐出林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41475,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古楼","author":"何绛","text":"地接昌华近，楼开碧树深。\n独怜高处望，难作此时心。\n城郭岂不古，山川徒至今。\n朝台无陆贾，谁复嗣徽音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41476,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"半帆","author":"何绛","text":"江流分别涧，日听水潺潺。\n片席如来去，诸僧任往还。\n好风吹不尽，皓月照常閒。\n毕竟归何处，茫茫天地间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41477,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月步","author":"何绛","text":"堤东月初上，一半在方塘。\n夜色澹逾静，荷风远更香。\n此心行不尽，今夕思何长。\n引领遥相望，钟声似有霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41478,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"何绛","text":"众卉已零落，芳菲惟此枝。\n自怜违世者，独对雪霜姿。\n岂但怀高洁，悠然兴远思。\n佳人消息渺，折汝欲何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41479,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老榕","author":"何绛","text":"幸得存生意，先朝雨露恩。\n低枝盘小阁，留荫在平原。\n盛夏炎偏减，高天日易昏。\n良材吾所惧，匠石顾何烦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41480,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尺木桥","author":"何绛","text":"盈盈水一方，携手上河梁。\n荷叶齐人半，月光随板长。\n隐同疏磬过，若共逝川忙。\n叹息如斯水，令余心事伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41481,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小浮山","author":"何绛","text":"造化良难测，浮山到寺东。\n影随潮汐动，奇尽鬼神工。\n树荫过桥客，花飞近谷风。\n半帆闲伫立，相望意何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41482,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云半阁","author":"何绛","text":"老僧开竹阁，缥缈倚城西。\n松际日初上，窗间云渐低。\n经教童子读，法说众生迷。\n不是高贤至，寻常懒下梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41483,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淀心亭","author":"何绛","text":"小亭斜向水，石路绕回廊。\n鹤过溪桥静，门空菡萏香。\n钟声清滞虑，草色引微凉。\n自到林中住，诸缘欲渐忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41484,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绘空轩","author":"何绛","text":"东林方丈室，日出何曈曈。\n树态晓潜变，云晴天欲空。\n看花已成色，闻鸟亦因风。\n物理犹如此，吾心良不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41485,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿杨敏叔","author":"何绛","text":"吾子尚如斯，皇天亦可知。\n老无扶杖日，神在据鞍时。\n至性存幽独，坚心涉乱离。\n华堂虽宴乐，恐尔未开眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41486,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同任肇楚家泽春桃溪夜话","author":"何绛","text":"城上柝声沉，草堂灯正深。\n须知长夜话，多是隔年心。\n初月不盈沼，凉风渐满林。\n当杯宜尽醉，吾辈重知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与岑霍山北海夜泊时有下园探梅之行","author":"何绛","text":"一棹维江上，严寒逼缊袍。\n虫声随岸尽，月色付潮高。\n白发心犹壮，青山兴尚豪。\n梅花冰雪质，恐亦爱吾曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭太史 其一","author":"何绛","text":"微风起阿阁，朝日映窗虚。\n正有词臣在，閒观中禁书。\n风流追晋代，翰墨过黄初。\n早晚承天诏，园林非久居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭太史 其二","author":"何绛","text":"夏月衣轻葛，临风绮户开。\n冰盘吴女捧，蒲扇越人裁。\n琢句题湘管，煎茶授宋杯。\n宫辞推第一，亲自到蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭太史 其三","author":"何绛","text":"玉轸六瑩琴，纱窗弹夜深。\n如何山水志，迸出庙廊心。\n素月经银汉，閒情在翠林。\n几时花下路，缓步一相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭太史 其四","author":"何绛","text":"供奉常开馆，频徵绝妙词。\n应刘才盖代，元白少逢时。\n选伎吹匏管，清歌出柳丝。\n从容觞政下，惟爱漏声迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雷峰三访圆和尚","author":"何绛","text":"雷峰峰上寺，策杖复相过。\n地静潮声近，山斜阁道多。\n虫声藏落叶，树鸟弄清歌。\n不说法闻竟，松风起夕阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄丹霞圆音和尚 其一","author":"何绛","text":"青山西北望，迢遰百重云。\n知尔安禅处，松风夜夜闻。\n月明诸嶂合，泉响数溪分。\n便欲谢城郭，相随鹿豕群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄丹霞圆音和尚 其二","author":"何绛","text":"尚忆河梁饯，清霜下素秋。\n汐来衰草外，人上夕阳舟。\n既已空诸破，应无此别愁。\n如何行与立，惆怅不能休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿滋广上人五山精舍","author":"何绛","text":"微风起山上，竹榻觉寒增。\n烟彻三生梦，心清一夜灯。\n逃禅尘外客，入定月中僧。\n好是阶前菊，沁人香且澄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞圆音和尚惠顾香草庄三日连宵同谦长侄作诗志喜 其一","author":"何绛","text":"不辞千里远，杖锡下岖嵚。\n古佛诚难遇，穷乡枉见寻。\n拈提忘后夜，听纳在虚襟。\n深自惭非器，皇皇觅我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41497,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞圆音和尚惠顾香草庄三日连宵同谦长侄作诗志喜 其二","author":"何绛","text":"数杯池上茗，共坐到宵分。\n月满江村树，风吹岛屿云。\n閒于世事懒，老入净林勤。\n已觉提持竟，殊乖眼处闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41498,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞圆音和尚惠顾香草庄三日连宵同谦长侄作诗志喜 其三","author":"何绛","text":"荒园涉成趣，杂花当径侵。\n俗尘不到处，树色入庭深。\n好鸟鸣清昼，澄澜净素心。\n劳师三日客，难得是知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41499,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠海幢慧轮大师","author":"何绛","text":"江楼入道者，徙倚肆閒情。\n露结新秋树，风高海气清。\n倾心持苦行，至性自多生。\n切莫黄梅去，归难庾岭行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41500,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸未始秋得丹霞愿来大师书并惠木樨饯作此答之 其一","author":"何绛","text":"云月未常殊，溪山各自居。\n怀师不可见，独坐对窗虚。\n杖履别来久，道心日以疏。\n不缘新雁至，安得入秋书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41501,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"癸未始秋得丹霞愿来大师书并惠木樨饯作此答之 其二","author":"何绛","text":"河干从别后，两度隔秋霜。\n不是怜聋俗，音书谁寄将。\n如何琼玖赠，忽觉木樨香。\n自匪承当者，空惭负晦堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41502,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁翅青门送任肇楚归冈州","author":"何绛","text":"城边芳草绿，为我长离忧。\n良友难为别，王孙不可留。\n凉风吹海月，高咏过滩流。\n应念秋来约，迟君江上楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41503,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白山大师非台落成相对坐月","author":"何绛","text":"虞园留片地，抔土便成台。\n静夜凉风起，菩提叶叶来。\n虚空呈皓月，清迥绝尘埃。\n了自不能寐，心心觉已灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41504,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送颐庵叔设帐浔阳","author":"何绛","text":"虽居南北海，相送几徘徊。\n新柳黄金艳，高斋绛帐开。\n文章倾上国，教育得英才。\n小子皆狂简，还期所以裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41505,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿慧云庵呈得闻上人","author":"何绛","text":"托宿幽林里，自然尘梦稀。\n秋风吹石榻，江月上松扉。\n渐老为心切，清宵体性微。\n晨钟一一动，吾亦薄言归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41506,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑珠江太史还朝","author":"何绛","text":"榆树今朝见，秋风满海涯。\n故人贤太史，倚棹入京华。\n江上一杯酒，盘中七月瓜。\n离筵殊朴略，谅我是田家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41507,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿始一上人","author":"何绛","text":"重过花甲日，仙处下生乡。\n七步周行已，三镫不住光。\n松花当午食，柏子供秋香。\n不是云门棒，宗风那阐扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41508,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华山访徐昭法","author":"何绛","text":"木兰舟楫系垂杨，十里溪桥到草堂。\n松子落山村路静，稻花流水野田香。\n身因时异思深隐，发为愁多带浅霜。\n归路向城回首数，柴门客去掩斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41509,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山","author":"何绛","text":"万里寒波一点青，碧栏朱槛昼烧灯。\n入江塔影随流动，倚石楼台好晚登。\n鱼听寺钟知出食，浪回烟艇渡归僧。\n游人莫向西南望，远色苍苍是秣陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41510,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏赠叶汉客","author":"何绛","text":"黄金散尽眼犹青，坐久蒲团竹槛凭。\n身老尚存浮海兴，心閒常似住山僧。\n野蔬自采充斋食，破衲亲缝礼佛镫。\n一自昔时辞旧国，十年清梦到无曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41511,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"何绛","text":"霜雪东南静不尘，楚天寥落在清晨。\n两城日下洞庭水，孤渡时归汉口人。\n异境岂因黄鹤得，旅游何意白髭新。\n连年无事江潭上，芳草萋萋今又春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41512,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日黄鹤楼留别毛子霞","author":"何绛","text":"楚国轻阴雨欲稀，岁朝高倚鹤楼扉。\n城边巴水为西郭，席处江云上布衣。\n春酒畏寒知渐老，旅人频叹念将归。\n怜君别后重过此，空有杨花旦暮飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41513,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日甘泉道中","author":"何绛","text":"连天衰草渐黄昏，匹马南来独怆神。\n九日有霜沾木叶，十年无计谢风尘。\n金台暂到非为客，易水长歌不入秦。\n遥忆弟兄当此会，登高何处望游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41514,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拖板桥访胡星卿","author":"何绛","text":"板桥东去入孤村，夹岸春云带小轩。\n疏竹叶边斜有路，碧桃花下正开门。\n心閒久薄公卿贵，身隐仍愁姓字尊。\n鸡黍款留长日语，野田相送出黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41515,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都门访程周量","author":"何绛","text":"绿槐门外解征鞍，暂听乡音似梦残。\n别后新诗皆老大，镫前细语几悲欢。\n人于异地情偏洽，酒到深更力易寒。\n少小读书怀北阙，此身今已在长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41516,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]